1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Bro, you use GitHub Copilot? Your job is already at risk.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Stack Overflow's 2024 survey revealed — 76% developers now use AI coding tools.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:23,000
But the problem? When Copilot writes code, you're just copy-pasting — not understanding the logic.

4
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:33,000
A LinkedIn study found Indian fresher devs who rely only on AI have 40% weaker problem-solving skills vs manual coders.

5
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Companies are banning Copilot in interviews — and those failing are devs who can't write a single function without the tool.

6
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:49,000
The tool should be your assistant, not your replacement.

